{"data": [{"author_id": "793853199975272448", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:09:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120141852020244703"], "id": "2120141852020244703", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 3617, "like_count": 85, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108932130235699495", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "台湾2026年10月出生人口暴跌15.0％ \n2026年10月台湾出生人口只有8035人，死亡人口17393人。其中出生人口相比去年同期减少15.0％，相比前年同期减少33.4％，已经连续19个月不足1万人 \n台湾继续超自我灭绝的道路狂奔，沾了进步主义经济再好也没用 https://t.co/XQRUMHgxSY", "url": "https://x.com/Jasuki__Hope/status/2120141852020244703"}, {"author_id": "2117517033713897472", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:00:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120396300067987587"], "id": "2120396300067987587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 88, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "幼儿园、小学、初中学龄人口已经达峰，对教育行业意味着什么？哪些新变化值得关注？\n\n人口出生的高峰期是在2016年，那时刚放开二胎，新出生人口达到1883万人，随后基本上就开启下降通道，到2025年时，新出生人口只有792万人。", "url": "https://x.com/JohnSimthxe7f/status/2120396300067987587"}, {"author_id": "1724204015733407744", "created_at": "2026-11-11T05:44:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120392138559037515"], "id": "2120392138559037515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 145, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "先说事实：\n2025年中国全年出生人口为 792万人，\n1949年以来年出生人口首次跌破800万。", "url": "https://x.com/sunny230713/status/2120392138559037515"}, {"author_id": "1526940839833763843", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:46:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120437876340994217"], "id": "2120437876340994217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突然有点好奇\n\n今年中国的新出生人口会有多少，去年是792万\n\n@grok帮我预测下", "url": "https://x.com/wenjieHe20/status/2120437876340994217"}, {"author_id": "1670961752459325441", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120141097796284871"], "id": "2120141097796284871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "如果生育率保持目前的水平，美国将在2080年代的某个时候超过中国的年出生人口数量，并在2120年左右超过中国的总人口数量。", "url": "https://x.com/nbdxe/status/2120141097796284871"}, {"author_id": "1562136801183027200", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:19:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120491486274068682", "2120491622614118515"], "id": "2120491486274068682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "盘点各国未能顺利出生人口🥺\n\n🇬🇱 格陵兰：59.09%\n🇬🇵 瓜德罗普：48.34%\n🇨🇺 古巴：47.62%\n🇲🇶 马提尼克：45.57%\n🇦🇿 阿塞拜疆：43.34%\n🇧🇶 博奈尔：38.90%\n🇨🇳 中国大陆：7…显示更多%", "url": "https://x.com/pnsin1/status/2120491486274068682"}, {"author_id": "1562136801183027200", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:19:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120491486274068682", "2120491622614118515"], "id": "2120491622614118515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 375, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "盘点各国未能顺利出生人口🥺\n\n🇬🇱 格陵兰：59.09%\n🇬🇵 瓜德罗普：48.34%\n🇨🇺 古巴：47.62%\n🇲🇶 马提尼克：45.57%\n🇦🇿 阿塞拜疆：43.34%\n🇧🇶 博奈尔：38.90%\n🇨🇳 中国大陆：7…显示更多", "url": "https://x.com/pnsin1/status/2120491622614118515"}, {"author_id": "1597775547169382400", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:47:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120060749452362027"], "id": "2120060749452362027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "是谁成功把孩子生在了升学巅峰？\n2016年出生1786万人，2034年高考最难！\n一张表看清幼升小、中考、高考时间线\n看看你家娃踩在哪个段位？\n#升学规划 #出生人口 #高考\n#点赞+收藏+关注# https://t.co/1b1GLbmuds", "url": "https://x.com/ShengHu8964/status/2120060749452362027"}, {"author_id": "15315460", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:25:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120432722242097276"], "id": "2120432722242097276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 660, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "刷​⁣⁣⁣‌‌⁣⁣⁣⁣‌⁣‌‌⁣⁣‌⁣‌‌‌⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣⁣‌‌⁣‌⁣⁣‌⁣⁣⁣⁣‌‌⁣‌⁣⁣⁣‌⁣‌‍到个短视频\n说卫生巾销量下滑\n这不是很正常嘛\n\n人口数量最大的那波（女）人\n陆续进入绝经期\n后面几拨出生人口数量又指数级下降\n与人口数量叠加顶峰期相比\n下滑太正常了", "url": "https://x.com/fooarch/status/2120432722242097276"}, {"author_id": "1080593132482260992", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:36:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120284404375507346"], "id": "2120284404375507346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 191, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【2026年台湾出生人口】\n\n口径：内政部户政统计，截至2026年10月\n\n今年1–10月：77,481人\n10月单月：8,035人\n全年预计：约9.5万人（估算）\n2025年全年：107,812人\n2024年全年：134,856人\n2023年全年：135,571人\n\n---\n\n【结论】\n今年将再创历史新低，比去年再少约12%\n连续十一年下降 https://t.co/oX2fXYaCJ5", "url": "https://x.com/Stanley_Liu2018/status/2120284404375507346"}, {"author_id": "163713680", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120424539331138027"], "id": "2120424539331138027", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "发改委今天说了个大拐点，幼儿园、小学、初中的学龄人口已经达峰了～😈\n\n         十四五这几年在校生少了将近1700万人，去年出生人口792万，只有2016年高峰的一半多一点～🕐\n\n         学校关得也快，去年小学少了8000所，幼儿园少了2.14万所～😓", "url": "https://x.com/yangye01/status/2120424539331138027"}, {"author_id": "1486571626661437440", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:03:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120125197344997506"], "id": "2120125197344997506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 7680, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118965668741881938", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "关于人口老龄化，咱们此前分享过建国后的三波婴儿潮，今天着重聊聊第二波：六三婴儿潮。👶🏻\n\n1960年代初，三年困难时期结束后，中国迎来了一大波补偿性生育。1962到1975年，平均每年出生约2600万人。其中1963年接近3000万，是建国以来出生人口最多的一年，因此也被叫六三婴儿潮。 https://t.co/NIL9mNWF7e https://t.co/ymxa9ptCAe", "url": "https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2120125197344997506"}, {"author_id": "23585341", "created_at": "2026-11-11T05:28:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120388065533493403"], "id": "2120388065533493403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 153, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "昨天发改委发话，幼儿园、小学、初中，学龄人口全达峰了（有点奇怪，怎么会是发改委来说这事）。 https://t.co/nYOvUhy8Zh", "url": "https://x.com/gordon758/status/2120388065533493403"}, {"author_id": "3868328413", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:17:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120324896572264595"], "id": "2120324896572264595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【台灣人口連續34個月下降】\n台灣內政部門10日公布最新統計，截至今年10月底，台灣總人口降至2320.4萬人，較上月減少9251人，連續34個月下降，少子化與人口老齡化問題持續加劇。 https://t.co/a3L1KTNd5s", "url": "https://x.com/Tong_Shuo/status/2120324896572264595"}, {"author_id": "1815793493526360065", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:16:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120430355207594417"], "id": "2120430355207594417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 535, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120419353111765294", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "美国人口结构自20世纪中后期（尤其是1965年《移民与国籍法》后）确实发生了显著变化，与“移民较少”的时期相比，现在的构成、社区和文化已不再相同。\n\n基于最新普查与研究数据的关键变化： https://t.co/kCJJabVdRB", "url": "https://x.com/WizarGod/status/2120430355207594417"}, {"author_id": "2080900856090886144", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119958222559912204"], "id": "2119958222559912204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 12538, "like_count": 79, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "中国经济已经无药可救？六大结构性危机全面爆发，习近平再怎么撒钱也没用！\n\n中国经济为什么越救越糟？为什么中共不断发钱、化债、发行国债、推出平准基金，投入巨额资金刺激经济，却始终无法扭转经济下行的趋势？ https://t.co/rGfq9YMXLd", "url": "https://x.com/ZhaiTalk/status/2119958222559912204"}, {"author_id": "1820199690241007616", "created_at": "2026-11-11T04:34:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120374470175305799"], "id": "2120374470175305799", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1103, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Western Australian TFR by LGA 2025.\n\nNotes: \n\n-There’s a big gap in information for many remote LGAs.\n\n-The states fertility situation is pretty dire, only a handful of very aged LGAs have a somewhat resilient TFR, the pool of woman in childbearing years in these places is a https://t.co/CEvviMxcTN", "url": "https://x.com/0bservationism/status/2120374470175305799"}, {"author_id": "1674860256562667520", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:42:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119953723082543168"], "id": "2119953723082543168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I just went ahead and saw the fertility reports of every single country.\nWhite populations plus Japan have increased slightly \n\nTop three countries with the lowest TFR :\n1.) North Korea- 0.4\n2.) South Korea- 0.7\n3. Macau- 0.7", "url": "https://x.com/KaliKrause968/status/2119953723082543168"}, {"author_id": "397938935", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:25:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120417736866381831"], "id": "2120417736866381831", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NFHS-5 (2019-21) के आंकड़ों के अनुसार मुस्लिम समुदाय की Total Fertility Rate (TFR) में सबसे तेज गिरावट दर्ज हुई है। \nतुलना (NFHS-1, 1992-93 से NFHS-5, 2019-21 तक):\n•  मुस्लिम: 4.41 से 2.36 → लगभग 46.5% की गिरावट (सबसे तेज) https://t.co/mrPrt4YO9j", "url": "https://x.com/ansh_pinara/status/2120417736866381831"}, {"author_id": "2000331666422984704", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:07:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120458452954980754"], "id": "2120458452954980754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120445428579639731", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Fertility is dropping globally (Europe at 1.6), but in Latvia it’s a freefall: from 1.74 (2016) to 1.16 (2025).\nA question for #LBconference: what is the central bank’s model at a 1.1 TFR? Who will fund pensions and a €30B debt?\n@LatvijasBanka @MartinsKazaks #IzraviensLV https://t.co/uIIb9IykQJ https://t.co/Qj3fsGd1ED", "url": "https://x.com/IzraviensLV/status/2120458452954980754"}, {"author_id": "1853173172327120896", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:25:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120206233059885497"], "id": "2120206233059885497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 173, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119894504530698253", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Once women used to be the flagbearer of fertility, they loved and wanted kids after kids so that the civilization gets saved to the point that they went on to have excess.\n\nThe women nowadays are complete opposite, they HATE children and wants the civilization to end with low tfr https://t.co/vO82vQUGES", "url": "https://x.com/don_sarrismo/status/2120206233059885497"}, {"author_id": "2016398423830757377", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:31:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120539990165741623", "2120540269707759695"], "id": "2120539990165741623", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I don't have data to prove this (how could I?), but I'm pretty sure gypsies became a significant % of RO only in the past century/century and a half due to their delayed demographic transition (what happened at the macro level all around the globe &amp; esp relevant for", "url": "https://x.com/FridefAgrippa/status/2120539990165741623"}, {"author_id": "2016398423830757377", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:32:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120539990165741623", "2120540269707759695"], "id": "2120540269707759695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 128, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I don't have data to prove this (how could I?), but I'm pretty sure gypsies became a significant % of RO only in the past century/century and a half due to their delayed demographic transition (what happened at the macro level all around the globe &amp; esp relevant for", "url": "https://x.com/FridefAgrippa/status/2120540269707759695"}, {"author_id": "1803012493255598080", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:51:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120227932492681429"], "id": "2120227932492681429", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "What if we could fix the birth rate in America?\nBottom line: Adding the current abortion volume to live births would raise annual U.S. births from ~3.61 million to ~4.74 million and lift the general fertility rate from the low-50s to around 70 per 1,000 women 15–44 (and the TFR", "url": "https://x.com/Pb3377_/status/2120227932492681429"}, {"author_id": "2108742622118322176", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:48:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120181868070945052"], "id": "2120181868070945052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 190, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120150130036805819", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Today we have declining fertility across the world broadly. \n\nI would expect we would enter an era of stagnation and decline without at or above replacement fertility, except for one possible wrench thrown in, which is IVG. As it stands, IVF is only used by 2% of people, but IVF https://t.co/WJGzRCwMdO", "url": "https://x.com/NataliaBower100/status/2120181868070945052"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "793853199975272448", "name": "Jasuki__Hope", "username": "Jasuki__Hope"}, {"id": "2117517033713897472", "name": "戶生花", "username": "JohnSimthxe7f"}, {"id": "1724204015733407744", "name": "此心安处", "username": "sunny230713"}, {"id": "1526940839833763843", "name": "草台班子", "username": "wenjieHe20"}, {"id": "1670961752459325441", "name": "RawRobot", "username": "nbdxe"}, {"id": "1562136801183027200", "name": "SeNa", "username": "pnsin1"}, {"id": "1597775547169382400", "name": "盛虎🇺🇸", "username": "ShengHu8964"}, {"id": "15315460", "name": "FQ", "username": "fooarch"}, {"id": "1080593132482260992", "name": "stanley", "username": "Stanley_Liu2018"}, {"id": "163713680", "name": "yangye", "username": "yangye01"}, {"id": "1486571626661437440", "name": "耶律律", "username": "Yelvlv930"}, {"id": "23585341", "name": "九然", "username": "gordon758"}, {"id": "3868328413", "name": "通說", "username": "Tong_Shuo"}, {"id": "1815793493526360065", "name": "Fight Evil！", "username": "WizarGod"}, {"id": "2080900856090886144", "name": "翟山鹰脱口秀", "username": "ZhaiTalk"}, {"id": "1820199690241007616", "name": "🇦🇶Svolvær", "username": "0bservationism"}, {"id": "1674860256562667520", "name": "Kali Krause", "username": "KaliKrause968"}, {"id": "397938935", "name": "انس پینارا", "username": "ansh_pinara"}, {"id": "2000331666422984704", "name": "Izrāviens | Breakthrough", "username": "IzraviensLV"}, {"id": "1853173172327120896", "name": "Atalanta Matches Views", "username": "don_sarrismo"}, {"id": "2016398423830757377", "name": "Agrippa 🇷🇴", "username": "FridefAgrippa"}, {"id": "1803012493255598080", "name": "Dr3am Weaver", "username": "Pb3377_"}, {"id": "2108742622118322176", "name": "Natalia Bower", "username": "NataliaBower100"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2120540269707759695", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlzczhorizs30jpphaarx3ogvdrx", "oldest_id": "2119953723082543168", "result_count": 25}}
